\title{rsmFlow: Design-Aware Response Surface Modelling and Optimization}
\description{A response-surface workflow for two or more quantitative factors, with design diagnostics, canonical analysis, local/global optimization, optimum uncertainty, multiresponse analysis, economic optimum calculations, and modern graphics. Mixture experiments are outside scope.}
